<title>UK: Allied Colloids Q1 like-for-like up 7 pct.</title>
<headline>Allied Colloids Q1 like-for-like up 7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>British industrial chemicals firm Allied Colloids Group Plc said on Wednesday like-for-like sales in the first quarter of the financial year were up seven percent on the same period last year.</p>
</text>
